    <briefdescription>
<para>HTTP负载均衡管理器 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>管理多个后端节点，按策略分发请求。 支持主动健康检查和故障转移。</para>
<para>使用示例： <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">load_balancer<sp/>lb;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">lb.add_backend({</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;web1&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>ports(8080)});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">lb.add_backend({</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;web2&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>ports(8080)});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">lb.set_strategy(<ref refid="group___h_t_t_p_1ggaf6b6bb3dae52d6afe10be25d22c4c5aba9b5adc9c167d99cbc016b883cf6a8600" kindref="member">lb_strategy::LEAST_CONNECTIONS</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>backend<sp/>=<sp/>lb.select_backend();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(backend)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>转发请求到<sp/>backend</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>lb.release_backend(backend);<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>请求完成后调用</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
